---
# Static analysis profile from docs/HANDOFF.md §7.1: bugprone, cert, clang-analyzer.
#
# Disabled:
# - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: flags most (buf, len, off) helpers; too noisy.
# - clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling: flags every
#   memcpy/memset/snprintf and recommends C11 Annex K (*_s) functions, which glibc and
#   nxdk's PDCLib don't provide. Bounds are enforced by our checked read helpers instead
#   (HANDOFF §7.3).
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
# Only our own code; third_party/ is never analysed.
HeaderFilterRegex: '(core|platform|app|tools)[/\\].*'
...
